  {
    "id": "2204375247",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Spirited Away - Haku and Chihiro",
    "description": "Original artwork by Asur-Misoa\r\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/asur-misoa/art/Spirited-Away-Fanart-Chihiro-777761708\r\n\r\nBGM:\r\nThe Name of Life/ Inochi No Namae by Joe Hisashi (Spirited Away OST)\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H1r-OAnpZ9o\r\n\r\n***alternate link:***\r\nSpirited Away 2001 - The Name of Life Instrumental Piano Inochi No Namae\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vMboypSkj3c&ab_channel=TheStudioGhibliCollection\r\n\r\nLast August 11, 2020, one of my closest grandfather died. Few days before his death, I still managed to talk to him through video call. I learned that his condition was declining because for 3 weeks, he was not able to have his dialysis because he needed several blood transfusion. It was hard for the whole family because when I saw him for the last time, I told my cousin that he may not live that long. After seeing my grandfather like one of my patients when I was still a nurse, I discussed to them what might and/or will happen and asked them to accompany him during his final hours.\r\n\r\nI was animating different wallpapers over the past week, to avert my attention from his death. During his wake, I asked my cousins if they wanted a custom wallpaper. One of them told me that she wanted a picture of Haku from Spirited Away. I rewatched the whole film, and hoped to find a wallpaper that could portray my favorite soundtrack from the film. I then saw Asur-Misoa's illustration of Haku and Chihiro, which fits the parting feeling that I felt with my grandfather. \r\n\r\nI really wanted to make her illustration as a wallpaper but the only available format is in portrait. So I researched on youtube on how to draw clouds and practiced using the Huion tablet that I bought a year ago, thinking that I might be able to learn digital art. I used Medibang app, Adobe Photoshop CS6, Paint, and lots of videos on youtube and patience to create a landscape. Here is the result. I hope you enjoy.\r\n\r\n\r\nChange notes:\r\n02/24/21\r\n-Removed the blue aura around the dragon's mane to make it look smoother.",
    "author": {
      "name": "",
      "steamId": "76561198147184800"
    },
    "previewUrl": "https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/1767071261463626408/8E6371F26C6F52A9BA6B0837B330BEECEE04393F/",
    "type": "Scene",
    "resolution": "2560x1440",
    "aspectRatio": "16:9",
